// RUN: edaxc run --root=%S/cpp_wrap_project --out-dir=%t app
// g.wrap_cpp: C++ classes (and a template instance) used from Edax through generated C wrappers:
// constructors as `make`, overloads and operators under the names the report lists, a thrown
// exception as a std::cpp_exception error, destructors when the Edax objects are dropped.
